<title>UK: Hypo Bank set warrants on Deutsche Telekom.</title>
<headline>Hypo Bank set warrants on Deutsche Telekom.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hypo Bank says it has issued 20</p>
<p>million American-style call and put warrants, in four equal</p>
<p>tranches, on Deutsche Telekom.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	 ISS PRICE	MATURITY</p>
<p> CALL A	  35.00 DEM    2.60 DEM	 20.MAR.98</p>
<p> PUT B	   35.00 DEM    4.10 DEM	 20.MAR.98</p>
<p> CALL C	  40.00 DEM    2.50 DEM	 19.NOV.99</p>
<p> PUT D	   30.00 DEM    3.10 DEM	 19.NOV.99</p>
<p> PAYDATE 26.NOV.96    LISTING FFT MUN    MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
